# cadence/purpose requires an explicit Owner decision -- never a default/
# automatic action by any script, worker, or session. This pair is committed
# here as a version-controlled reference copy ONLY (same precedent already
# used for systemd/veridian-pm-report-tick.service in this same directory).
# It has deliberately NOT been copied into ~/.config/systemd/user/ and has
# NOT been enabled/started. That copy + `systemctl --user daemon-reload` +
